            "text": "theorem sourceJet_eq_deriv_inverse_iterate\n    (J : (ℝ × E → F) → (ℝ × E → F)) (f : ℝ × E → F) (p : ℕ)\n    (hcomm : Function.Commute slowDeriv J) :\n    sourceJet J f p = slowDeriv^[p] (J^[p] f)"
